            rdf:value "The soil’s intrinsic permeability to air, expressed by the coefficient ka in Darcy’s relation qa = −(ka/ηa)(dp/dx), where qa is air-volume flux per area, ηa is air viscosity, and dp/dx is the pressure gradient."@en ] ;
    skos:exactMatch spp:SoilAirPermeability ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/eusoilvoc> ;
    skos:prefLabel "soil air permeability"@en .

