eusoilvoc:SoilWetting a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader eusoilvoc:SoilWaterPhysicalProcesses ;
    skos:definition [ dcterms:source <https://doi.org/10.4324/9780203021231> ;
            rdf:value "The spreading of applied water along soil-particle surfaces as attraction between soil and water overcomes cohesion within the water; a continuous water film on the particles permits uniform infiltration or percolation into the soil matrix."@en ] ;
